sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Server as 服务端
    participant API as LLM API

    Note over Client,API: SSE 流式请求
    Client->>Server: HTTP GET (SSE)
    Server->>API: 发起流式请求
    API-->>Server: event: message_start
    Server-->>Client: event: message_start

    Note over API,Client: Token 逐个推送
    API-->>Server: event: content_block_delta {"text":"你"}
    Server-->>Client: data: {"delta":{"text":"你"}}
    API-->>Server: event: content_block_delta {"text":"好"}
    Server-->>Client: data: {"delta":{"text":"好"}}
    API-->>Server: event: content_block_delta {"text":"，"}
    Server-->>Client: data: {"delta":{"text":"，"}}

    Note over API,Client: 结束
    API-->>Server: event: message_stop
    Server-->>Client: data: [DONE]

    Note over Client: 拼接所有 text-delta = "你好，"
